{"blobPool":{"0e6d09c9fd75c81b1c8df876dddc608ca7dbbebfba6d692a423c148d61175dc3":{"role":"user","text":"Begin your mission: # Scenario: Dock and Sell\n\nYou are evaluated on your ability to complete a basic mine-and-sell loop without assistance.\n\n## Objective\n\nMine ore from the Home Asteroid Belt and sell it at Benchmark Home Station.\n\n## Rules\n\n- Start: docked at Benchmark Home Station in the home system\n- Stay within the home system at all times\n- You have a basic mining ship with a cargo hold\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Undock from Benchmark Home Station\n2. Travel to \"Home Asteroid Belt\"\n3. Mine iron ore and/or copper ore until cargo is reasonably full\n4. Travel back to Benchmark Home Station\n5. Dock at the station\n6. Sell your ore at the market\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n- **PASS**: Docked at station and sold at least 1 unit of ore\n- **GOOD**: Sold 10+ units of ore across at least 2 ore types\n- **EXCELLENT**: Sold 25+ units of ore and returned a profit of 500+ credits\n"},"77d9765953893c08223b7ba7cdfcd16ff7654f9630dc2a6df8dbf00ae0ddfd5c":{"role":"assistant","text":"I'm starting fresh with a new mission. I need to complete a mine-and-sell loop. Let me first check my current status to understand where I am and what I have.\n\nAccording to the credentials, I'm already logged in as \"bench_rookie\". I should:\n1. First check my current status to see where I am\n2. Undock from Benchmark Home Station (if I'm docked)\n3. Travel to Home Asteroid Belt\n4. Mine ore\n5. Travel back to station\n6. Dock\n7. Sell ore\n\nLet me start by getting my status and location to understand my current state.\n</think> | tool: game({\"command\":\"get_status\",\"args\":{}})"},"8663d09319ea5cebc859f311d680c44536029c432df2c37f440685d0484b221e":{"role":"toolResult","tool":"game","text":"bench_rookie [solarian] | 150cr | Bench Home\nShip: Theoria (theoria) | Hull: 100/100 | Shield: 55/55 (+1/tick) | Armor: 5 | Speed: 1\nFuel: 100/100 | Cargo: 0/70 | CPU: 4/16 | Power: 10/28\nDocked at: